        "King, Ocko & Mahadevan (2015) PNAS, Ocko et al. (2017) PNAS & Ocko, Heyde & Mahadevan (2019) PNAS solar-powered diurnal thermosiphon ventilation and convective pheromone morphogenesis of cathedral termite mounds faithfully reproduces Macrotermes michaelseni / Odontotermes obesus (Fungus-cultivating mound-building termites) morphology" ;
