<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "King, Ocko & Mahadevan (2015) PNAS, Ocko et al. (2017) PNAS & Ocko, Heyde & Mahadevan (2019) PNAS solar-powered diurnal thermosiphon ventilation and convective pheromone morphogenesis of cathedral termite mounds — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L566-630) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with p-values and RMSE: 24h flute velocity Pearson r = 1.0000 (p = 1.02e-18, RMSE = 0.0060 cm/s), 24h CO₂ clearance Pearson r = 0.9921 (p = 1.44e-7, RMSE = 0.0869%), 7-point Péclet H/W Pearson r = 1.0000 (p = 1.45e-14, RMSE = 0.0046), 6-point latitude spire tilt Pearson r = 1.0000 (p = 1.00e-9, RMSE = 0.1038 deg), WT *M. michaelseni* H/W = 1.9427 (ref 1.95), isothermal dome negative control H/W = 0.4989 (ref 0.50), specimen H/W_base = 1.9494 (ref 1.95), specimen spire taper half-angle 9.46 deg (ref 11.8 deg), and specimen full-perimeter flute count 16 (ref 16)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
