<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "King, Ocko & Mahadevan (2015) PNAS, Ocko et al. (2017) PNAS & Ocko, Heyde & Mahadevan (2019) PNAS solar-powered diurnal thermosiphon ventilation and convective pheromone morphogenesis of cathedral termite mounds — MorphoEval overall 94.3/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2015-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys.py` (overall weighted score: 94.3/100, up from 56.8/100 in v1). The remediated script solves the coupled 24-hour diurnal solar-thermal buoyancy thermosiphon & Taylor–Aris oscillatory CO₂ ventilation cycle (flute velocity Pearson r = 1.0000, RMSE = 0.0060 cm/s; chimney CO₂ Pearson r = 0.9921, RMSE = 0.0869% CO₂; exact mass continuity A_c u_c + A_f u_f = 0); integrates the Ocko, Heyde & Mahadevan (2019) PNAS moving-boundary convective pheromone mound morphogenesis solver across the 7-point Péclet sweep Pe in [0.0, 4.2] (H/W Pearson r = 1.0000, RMSE = 0.0046) and 6-point Southern Hemisphere latitude equatorward spire tilt sweep |phi_lat| in [0.0, 24.0] deg S (Pearson r = 1.0000, RMSE = 0.1038 deg, Namibia 19.2 deg S -> 18.82 deg N tilt); evaluates *Macrotermes michaelseni*, *Odontotermes obesus*, and shaded/isothermal dome controls (Pe = 0 -> H/W = 0.4989); and segments the SHA-256-locked CC BY-SA 4.0 cathedral termite mound specimen (`macrotermes_cathedral_mound_specimen.jpg`, H/W_base = 1.9494, taper half-angle 9.46 deg, 8 visible front-hemisphere flutes = 16 full-perimeter flutes). Overall 94.3/100 (faithfulness 94.3, reproducibility 94.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 94, Parameter expressivity 94, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 94, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/termite_mound_convective_chimneys_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-ocko-termite-mound-convective-chimneys.py at e93f00e, image/png, 964600 B, 2775×1680 px, artifact_sha256 d49033b52ede8d1fd93cc88cfd1a7aa67db12aaac9cd0f8adc61a6292ba238e0 (sha256 d49033b52ede8d1fd93cc88cfd1a7aa67db12aaac9cd0f8adc61a6292ba238e0), spec_fingerprint d09fb37c4086797405dbf184a42b7af11e3ae9291d9bd6946a94bdc2be0204df. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d09fb37c4086797405dbf184a42b7af11e3ae9291d9bd6946a94bdc2be0204df; artifact_sha256: d49033b52ede8d1fd93cc88cfd1a7aa67db12aaac9cd0f8adc61a6292ba238e0; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/termite_mound_convective_chimneys/macrotermes_cathedral_mound_specimen.jpg=71ab909aae615390..., datasets/termite_mound_convective_chimneys/paper_citations.bib=21248770fa6f59e6..., datasets/termite_mound_convective_chimneys/scout_manifest.json=cdefb06d8e025efd..., datasets/termite_mound_convective_chimneys/termite_mound_convective_chimneys_reference.json=36184ab6989fedbf...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-termite-mound-convective-chimneys-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D/3D convective pheromone mound morphogenesis solver to micro-CT porous wall drainage permeability measurements across seasonal rainfall regimes." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.43e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

